    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with physics-based weapons and light capabilities, battle through hordes against all odds. Strategically choose upgrades to construct unique builds. Use various weapon types, such as pistols, rifles, shotguns, and grenades. Deploy light to illuminate the darkness and destroy enemies. Physics-based attacks stun and suspend foes to control the tide of battle. Unlock all achievements and see whether you can escape the depths of the void.</p>",
